    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c36869e5543aee090de71044",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就算之后还有『日本橡树大赛』，\n即便能瞄准三后冠――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ab0239263879c94d4ef60ce907645f6c1d1a92e2a17a2197d4518d2843b832d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a0ddb33e3eda5799d34a7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因为是新马级GⅠ的缘故吗。\n比起其他充满紧张感和狂热的GⅠ比赛，\n这里有种焕然一新的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "628664bdcf69f7c96869aecef3fc8a6ba54d21a275f22c3ef2a15aada7e83fa0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129116.json",
      "json_path": [
