        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:976a570817876e7650b8e3dd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没错！　抱歉我就是这么固执。\n但是、拜托了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40d4f0d7a61146f56b8ff72397f7193837bbddff3c62dab1470c6ed50639dfd3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cad0f5afe14291656cd76112",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目不会被记录所束缚。\n她只是――遵循自己的内心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "578c6ba768f374960fb3130f4271ce61e2d03ca841f2f02ad28aad9fcc51c347",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eaa1acfc2b2d1633b58dbf4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样，经典级的大目标定好了。\n三后冠的初战、『樱花赏』……\n她的情感所指引的未来究竟会――",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eb749d066f0eb6a358d4fbf04dc77dc748436d4eddd4fb2a2fdbebe403492d6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ffa00827ca5c674361496b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目",
      "source_fingerprint": "b632be927b5d52ab85b0cfae236cdc76e44b41d48ba6e925027a4013417d1d5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129116.json",
      "json_path": [
